WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.101 line:92%
-Well, I mentioned your kids.

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:02.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
I heard you recently took them
to Coney Island.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I did.
-Did they have a great time?

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.906 line:92%
-We had so much fun, you know.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.208 size:75% position:38% line:92%
They grew up in L.A.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
They haven't spent
a lot of time in New York.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:13.146
So I wanted them to have, like,
a real city experience.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wanted them
to experience the subway...

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-...which they, you know --

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.786 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That is a thing now

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:23.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is actually, like,
child endangerment.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:26.893 size:84% position:42%
-My kid thought it was
the coolest thing ever.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:27.594 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I have footage of my kid

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:30.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
literally just looking out
the window going...

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:31.631 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's great.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:32.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...I mean,
just thinking it's amazing.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They should rebrand
the New York City Subway

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:37.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
as like,
"The New York City Subway --

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.506 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Fun for 2 to 6."

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But we had --
we had a lot of fun.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:45.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's all these little
food stands there.

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.113
I don't know if you've seen it.
-Yeah, it's great.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so we stopped off
for some ribs,

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:53.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
as you do in Coney Island.
-Yeah.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Plus, you were covered
in fake blood,

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
so you thought,
"Oh, the ribs will cover."

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.224
-No, that was a different time.
-That's a different day.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, gotcha.
-That's a different day.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:04.330
And I'm ordering, and this lady
is trying to put it together.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100 size:84% position:42%
You know, she's like,
"I think -- Are you --"

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
But she's not
putting it together.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.837 line:92%
So she's doing the whole,

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Do you get --
Do you get that a lot?

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.909
That you look like that actress?
What's -- What's her...?

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.844
[Fingers snapping]
You know, who I'm talking about.

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know who
I'm talking about, right?

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:22.348 size:88% position:44%
You get it all the time.
You look just like her.
You look just like --"

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.452 size:78% position:39%
And then, eventually,
she puts it together,

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:28.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm just trying
to have a good time,

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:32.325
so I'm like, "Oh, God, yeah, no.
I get that all the time."

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she goes,
"Mm-hmm. You know what?

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, no.
You're skinnier than her."

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.599 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.633 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Literally. Literally.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, that's very interesting
because --

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know
if that's a compliment.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's the weird thing.
How do you take it?

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is that?
-Yeah.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was happy
and then super upset.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.579 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.713 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I guess -- You want --

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:57.750
You want real life to be the one
that gets the compliment.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know.
I need a real friend

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
to actually tell me
what that means.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Somebody who really loves me

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
and can actually
tell me something

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.025 line:92%
that I might not want to hear.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.428
-Well, you know, whenever
I want the real truth,

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go straight to the rib lady
at Coney Island.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:14.267 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.571
You grew up in South Africa.
You grew up around animals.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.339 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And my wife's family
had a pet goat.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
You had a pet goat growing up.
-Oh, really? Yes.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.946
-What was your pet goat's name?
-Bok.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Bok?
-Bok.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.315 line:92%
-Is that an Afrikaans word?

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's B-O-K.
And it means "goat."

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah. Very creative.

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:35.421 line:92%
-Did you have a long list?

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.524 line:92%
Did you whittle it down to Bok?

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was Bok confused
when other people

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
were just calling
for their goat?

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:47.667 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you --
Now, here's the thing.

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.037 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I had a long --

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:53.239 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:57.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had a long --
So, our goat, Raisin...

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.045 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:02.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
Raisin, sadly,
recently passed away.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Aww.
-He was fine.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:05.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait a minute. Time-out.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.788 size:84% position:42%
-No, but I didn't think
goats were good pets.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you think goats
were good pets?

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh. They're amazing.
I was -- How old?

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:16.496 size:81% position:41%
I was maybe like 8 --
between like 8 and 13.

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:19.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're super mischievous.
[mis-cheev-eus]

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:19.732 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Would you say "mis-cheev-eus"
or "mischievous"?

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We could do either one.
-Okay.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I would have said
"mischievous."

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:27.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mischievous.
They're very mischievous.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:30.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
They would jump on your bed
and kind of --

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.311 size:88% position:44% line:92%
They'd eat your clothes.

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:32.845
They eat everything.
-See, these -- It's interesting.

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
All the things that
you're framing as positives

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:36.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
would have been
the negatives for me.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know.
It was -- I don't know.

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was something sweet
about it.

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:43.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um, I mean, she would
just play with the fabric

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:45.225 line:92%
and then maybe get a hole in it,

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
but nothing, like, crazy,
you know?

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:48.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
But they get into everything.
I mean, they would stand

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:51.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
on the counters with
their little feet up, and...

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:53.166 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But they're super-loyal.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.467 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:55.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
Very loyal.
-Yeah.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:57.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they're very --
And they're really loving.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:04:01.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey! I'm actually sharing
something for real!

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.443 line:92%
Like, this is not a joke.

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:04.010 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is actually me
sharing a piece of my heart.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:09.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, guys!
Let Charlize talk about

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:12.252
how loyal her [bleep] goat was,
assholes.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.753 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:16.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm really sorry about this.
-I mean, seriously.

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:18.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know
what's got into them.

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:21.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't have any siblings!
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:22.328 line:92%
And if you had, their names

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:25.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
would have been
Sister or Brother.

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:26.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:31.170
It's really lovely to have you.
Charlize Theron, everybody.

